    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_SourceOriginIntegration">Origin library integration</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_OriginIntegrationsTab">Library integrations</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_OriginIntegrationsDescription">Uses the Playnite library integration that imported each game. The match is exact through the game&apos;s PluginId, so a Steam game is never queried through EA, Xbox or another unrelated integration.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_EnableOriginIntegrationMedia">Fetch media from the integration that imported the game (covers, icons and backgrounds) before using other sources</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_EnableOriginIntegrationAiContext">Use metadata from that integration as trusted context before asking the AI</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_EnableOriginIntegrationFacts">In strict mode, apply only verifiable facts from that integration, such as developers, publishers, age ratings and regions</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_OriginIntegrationsDetected">Detected library integrations</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_OriginIntegrationsHelp">Disable an integration here to stop Metadata AI from querying it. If an integration does not provide a requested field, the configured fallback sources are used automatically.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_RefreshOriginIntegrations">Refresh integrations</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_OriginIntegrationExactMedia">Exact media from the game&apos;s library integration</sys:String>
